{
  "name": "price-sensitivity-measurement",
  "description": "Measure willingness to pay with two methods. Van Westendorp asks four price questions and plots curves to find the acceptable range, and Gabor-Granger tests descending prices to find the revenue maximizing point. Reconcile both and adapt the result to the context, whether freelance rates, a subscription product, a physical product, or a salary ask.",
  "steps": [
    {
